擊楚，絕其後糧於梁地。漢四年冬，項王與漢王相距滎陽，彭越攻下睢陽、外黃十七城。項王聞之，乃使曹咎守成皋，自東收彭越所下城邑，皆復為楚。越將其兵北走穀城。漢五年秋，項王之南走陽夏，彭越復下昌邑旁二十餘城，得穀十餘萬斛，以給漢王食。"}],"rationale":"依同段及連續事件明示姓名與用稱暫接，仲按字仲與述贊承接；秦漢用稱不全域替換，未名者不補姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:p008","text":"漢王之敗彭城解而西也，彭越皆復亡其所下城，獨將其兵北居河上。漢王三年，彭越常往來為漢游兵，擊楚，絕其後糧於梁地。漢四年冬，項王與漢王相距滎陽，彭越攻下睢陽、外黃十七城。項王聞之，乃使曹咎守成皋，自東收彭越所下城邑，皆復為楚。越將其兵北走穀城。漢五年秋，項王之南走陽夏，彭越復下昌邑旁二十餘城，得穀十餘萬斛，以給漢王食。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"u2v_5ml_y4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"9h5_akj_wys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"u2v_5ml_y4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"9h5_akj_wys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"87m_fib_7uw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"u2v_5ml_y4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"9h5_akj_wys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"87m_fib_7uw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"曹咎","kind":"person","person_id":"7iw_jix_h9n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-090-wei:m008-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"9h5_akj_wys","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id